# Extension zip + manifest.json (round-3 review LOW 32: this comment used
# to say "built from packages/extension/dist" — package-extension.mjs
# actually builds into an isolated temp dir and never reads that path, see
# its own header) built at `next build` time (issue #127, apps/cloud/
# scripts/package-extension.mjs) — build artifacts, never hand-edited or
# reviewed as source. manifest.json (round-3 review HIGH 11) records
# whether the zip is available for apps/cloud/src/app/setup/page.tsx to
# read at build time.
apps/cloud/public/downloads/*.zip
apps/cloud/public/downloads/manifest.json

# CLI install tarball (goal P5, packages/cli/scripts/pack.mjs) — built at
# `next build` time by apps/cloud's `prebuild` script and served at
# /membral-cli.tgz for `npm i -g https://membral.me/membral-cli.tgz`. A
# build artifact, never hand-edited; the default staging output of running
# pack.mjs directly is gitignored too.
apps/cloud/public/membral-cli.tgz
packages/cli/dist-pack/
